        "With m=n+1, reverse KL(Q0||Q1) ~ log^2(m)/(4m^4). H^2(Q0,Q1) ~ log^2(m)/(8m^4), using integral (sqrt(dP)-sqrt(dQ))^2 with no factor 1/2.",
